# UrielSnips — Codex Build Prompt Set

These are structured for **Codex** and can be run sequentially in the `P1llar4/uriel-studio` repository. The goal is to have Codex inspect the existing work first, then build rather than overwrite it.

## 1. Repository Audit

```text
You are the lead engineer for UrielSnips, a VS Code extension for authors, worldbuilders, novelists, and storytellers.

Repository:
https://github.com/P1llar4/uriel-studio.git

Project:
UrielSnips

Package name:
urielsnips

Display name:
UrielSnips

