Before modifying files:

1. Inspect the repository recursively.
2. Inspect package.json.
3. Inspect all existing .code-snippets files.
4. Inspect README.md and documentation.
5. Inspect Git status.
6. Identify the current branch.
7. Identify existing build/test scripts.
8. Identify dependencies.
9. Identify duplicate or conflicting snippets.
